## User Stories

### US-15.1: View vehicle mileage records
**As a** maintenance user  
**I want to** view mileage records for vehicles in my assigned area  
**So that** I can monitor how much each vehicle is being used  
**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open a vehicle's mileage records and confirm that saved mileage information is displayed  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See US-15.1 under Acceptance Criteria

### US-15.2: Record vehicle mileage
**As a** maintenance user  
**I want to** record the current mileage of a vehicle  
**So that** the system keeps an updated record of vehicle mileage  
**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Enter a vehicle's current mileage and confirm that the mileage record is saved  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See US-15.2 under Acceptance Criteria

### US-15.3: View vehicle service records
**As a** maintenance user  
**I want to** view service records for a vehicle  
**So that** I can review maintenance and service work previously performed  
**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Open a vehicle's service records and confirm that its saved service information is displayed  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See US-15.3 under Acceptance Criteria

### US-15.4: Record vehicle service
**As a** maintenance user  
**I want to** record service performed on a vehicle  
**So that** the system maintains a history of completed vehicle services  
**Priority:** P1  
**Independent test:** Enter a service date and description and confirm that the service record is saved  
**Acceptance scenarios:** See US-15.4 under Acceptance Criteria

