## Requirements

## Functional Requirements

-- **FR-001:** A user must be signed in to access vehicle mileage and service log features.
-- **FR-002:** An authorized maintenance user must be able to view mileage records for vehicles they are permitted to manage.
-- **FR-003:** An authorized maintenance user must be able to record the current mileage of an existing vehicle.
-- **FR-004:** Every mileage record must be associated with one vehicle.
-- **FR-005:** Each mileage record must include the date recorded and current mileage.
-- **FR-006:** The system must validate that the selected vehicle exists before saving a mileage record.
-- **FR-007:** The system must validate that mileage is a valid non-negative numeric value.
-- **FR-008:** The system must allow authorized users to view service records associated with a vehicle.
-- **FR-009:** An authorized maintenance user must be able to record a service performed on an existing vehicle.
-- **FR-010:** Every service record must be associated with one vehicle.
-- **FR-011:** Each service record must include the service date and a description of the service performed.
-- **FR-012:** The system must validate that the selected vehicle exists before saving a service record.
-- **FR-013:** An area administrator must be able to view and manage mileage and service records for vehicles in their area.
-- **FR-014:** A system administrator must be able to view and manage mileage and service records across all areas.
-- **FR-015:** The system must display mileage and service information associated with the selected vehicle.
-- **FR-016:** The system must prevent unauthorized users from viewing or creating mileage and service records outside their permitted access.

